# lettermint_domain (Resource)

Manage a Lettermint sending domain.

## Example Usage

{{ tffile "examples/resources/lettermint_domain/resource.tf" }}

## Project Access

By default, every project in the team can send from a domain. Set `project_ids` to allow only those projects. An empty set allows every project again.

When you remove `project_ids` from the configuration, the provider stops managing the projects and does not change them in Lettermint.

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Import

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/lettermint_domain/import.sh" }}

An imported domain cannot recover `dns_records`. The provider does not request the optional DNS record relationship during a domain read.

An imported domain does not manage `project_ids`. Add `project_ids` to the configuration and apply it to set the projects.
